{"3312590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Helrift", "steam_appid": 3312590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Towns. One magical Rift. War is the only constant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helrift is a gritty MMORPG with old-school intensity, where two towns battle for territory, resources, and the very essence that is slowly poisoning the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Allegiance</strong>: Take up arms for one of two warring factions, each with unique history and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction Warfare:</strong> Engage in tactical PvP across contested zones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Conflict:</strong> Hunt monsters and experience massive, scheduled server-wide events where the Towns clash for dominance and reap the rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a Legend:</strong> Define your own combat style by shaping your stats, equipment, and skills. From battle mages to pure warriors, archers and agile, mana-infused scouts. Adapt your build to play your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living Economy:</strong> Create, find, buy, and sell essential gear as a specialized crafter, a travelling merchant, or a warrior looting  fallen monsters and player enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legends are not born, they are made. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two Towns. One magical Rift. War is the only constant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helrift is a gritty MMORPG with old-school intensity, where two towns battle for territory, resources, and the very essence that is slowly poisoning the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Allegiance</strong>: Take up arms for one of two warring factions, each with unique history and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><s